sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student
    participant V as ApplyComposeScreen (View)
    participant VM as ApplyComposeViewModel
    participant CL as CoverLetterService
    participant CS as CvSelectService
    participant CM as CvMatchService
    participant CV as CvValidationService
    participant AS as ApplicationService
    participant UP as UserProfileService
    participant EL as ExternalLinkService
    participant AN as AnalyticsService
    participant FS as Cloud Firestore
    participant FN as Cloud Functions
    participant MAIL as Device mail app

    Note over V,FS: 1. Open the form (prefill from Profile)
    Student->>V: taps "Apply now"
    V->>VM: provider build (autoDispose.family)
    VM->>UP: watchProfile(uid) + watchCvs(uid)
    UP->>FS: users/{uid} + users/{uid}/cvs
    FS-->>VM: UserProfile + List<CvFile>
    VM-->>V: ApplyComposeState (library, defaultCvFile)
    VM->>AN: logEvent("apply_start", {internship_id, source})

    Note over V,CS: 2. Optional AI CV suggestion (best CV for this listing)
    VM->>CS: select(internshipKey, storagePaths, defaultPath)
    CS->>FN: callable selectCv
    FN-->>VM: CvSelection (percent, matched, reason, cvReadable)
    VM-->>V: autoSelection • student may override with selectLibraryCv()

    Note over V,CL: 3. Compose the email (AI draft, editable)
    VM->>CL: compose(internshipKey, storagePath, studentName)
    CL->>FN: callable composeCoverLetter
    FN-->>VM: CoverLetterDraft (subject, body, usedAi)
    VM-->>V: regenerate() is AsyncLoading while in flight
    Student->>V: edits subject / body / recipient
    V->>VM: setSubject / setBody / setRecipient

    Note over V,CV: 4a. Branch — Validate CV (always) or Match CV first
    alt "Check my match" button
        V->>VM: buildSession()
        VM-->>V: ApplySession (cv, startedAt, email, details, skills, body)
        V->>VM: push /apply/match with extra = session
    end

    Note over CM,CV: 5. CV Match (advisory, never blocks)
    CM->>FN: callable matchCv(cvStoragePath, internshipKey)
    FN-->>CM: CvMatchResult (percent, matched, missing, suggestions)
    CM->>AN: logEvent("cv_match_check", {result, matched_count, missing_count})
    CM-->>V: ViewData<CvMatchResult> → Continue to Validate CV

    Note over CV,FN: 6. Validate CV (blocking quality gate)
    CV->>FN: callable validateCv(storagePath)
    FN->>FN: assertOwnedCvPath(uid, path)
    FN->>FN: download PDF → extract text → min 50 chars
    FN->>FN: askGemini(rubric, temperature 0)
    FN-->>CV: {isValid, reason?}
    CV->>AN: logEvent("cv_validation_result", {is_valid: 1|0})
    CV-->>V: ViewData / ViewError → Update CV or Retry

    Note over V,MAIL: 7. Send through the employer channel
    Student->>V: taps "Open email app"
    V->>VM: openEmail()
    VM->>VM: Validators.email(recipient)
    VM->>EL: openEmail(mailto: recipient?subject&body)
    EL->>MAIL: launch compose window
    MAIL-->>Student: student sends the mail themselves
    VM->>AN: logEvent("cover_letter_open", {...})

    Note over V,FS: 8. Record the application (the real write)
    Student->>V: taps "I sent it" (markSent)
    V->>VM: markSent()
    VM->>VM: guard isSending • _listing != null • fullName not empty
    VM-->>V: state.send = AsyncLoading (button disabled)
    VM->>AS: createApplication(internshipKey, title, companyName, cv*, applicant, recipientEmail, appliedVia: email)
    AS->>FS: users/{uid}/applications/{jobKey}.set({... status: submitted})
    alt write succeeds
        FS-->>AS: ack
        AS-->>VM: void
        VM->>UP: updateApplyDetails(uid, details) + updateSkills(uid, skills)
        Note over VM,UP: a Profile sync failure is logged to Crashlytics only,<br/>it never turns a stored submission into an error
        VM->>AN: logEvent("application_create", {internship_id, channel, cv_source, duration_sec})
        VM-->>V: ApplicationSent (submittedAt, internship)
        V->>V: pushReplacement success route with recap extra
    else Firestore / permission / network error
        FS-->>AS: FirebaseException
        AS-->>VM: throw AppException(kind, userMessage)
        VM-->>V: state.send = AsyncError
        V->>Student: error.message + Retry (no raw SDK error rendered)
    end

    Note over V,Student: 9. Application Success (stateless, no ViewModel)
    V->>V: ApplicationSuccessScreen renders recap from extra
    Student->>V: "View my applications" → /applications<br/>or "Back to Home" → /home
